    {"type": "rectangle", "id": "legend_box", "x": 50, "y": 1290, "width": 2290, "height": 110, "strokeColor": "#1e3a5f", "backgroundColor": "#dbeafe", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 500200, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 500201, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [{"id": "legend_t", "type": "text"}], "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": {"type": 3}},
    {"type": "text", "id": "legend_t", "x": 65, "y": 1305, "width": 2260, "height": 80, "text": "범례:  🟥 빨강 = CRITICAL (IRON RULE 적용, fail-safe 즉시)   |   🟧 주황 = HIGH (정상 운영 영향, 자동 복구)   |   🟨 노랑 = MEDIUM (degraded 상태로 계속 동작)\n모든 critical 모드는 NC 와이어링 + Watchdog 3-layer (Application 즉시 → systemd 30s → Kernel WDT 15s)로 backstop\n0 critical gap — 모든 failure에 detection + handling + automated test 보유 (plan-eng-review §3 IRON RULE C1/C2/C3)", "originalText": "범례:  🟥 빨강 = CRITICAL (IRON RULE 적용, fail-safe 즉시)   |   🟧 주황 = HIGH (정상 운영 영향, 자동 복구)   |   🟨 노랑 = MEDIUM (degraded 상태로 계속 동작)\n모든 critical 모드는 NC 와이어링 + Watchdog 3-layer (Application 즉시 → systemd 30s → Kernel WDT 15s)로 backstop\n0 critical gap — 모든 failure에 detection + handling + automated test 보유 (plan-eng-review §3 IRON RULE C1/C2/C3)", "fontSize": 12, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "middle", "strokeColor": "#374151", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 500202, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 500203, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": "legend_box", "lineHeight": 1.5}
